{
  "worlds": [],
  "quests": [
    {
      "id": "wordwood.gates",
      "world": "wordwood",
      "title": "The Twin Gates",
      "kind": "main",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "shut",
          "objective": "Talk to the gatekeeper.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "flag",
            "flag": "gates.met-shut",
            "value": true
          },
          "then": []
        },
        {
          "id": "ope",
          "objective": "Find the other gatekeeper.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "flag",
            "flag": "gates.asked",
            "value": true
          },
          "then": []
        },
        {
          "id": "lamp-a",
          "objective": "Light the lower trunk lamp.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "flag",
            "flag": "gates.lamp-a",
            "value": true
          },
          "then": []
        },
        {
          "id": "lamp-b",
          "objective": "Light the upper trunk lamp.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "flag",
            "flag": "gates.lamp-b",
            "value": true
          },
          "then": []
        },
        {
          "id": "tell",
          "objective": "Tell Shut what you lit.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "flag",
            "flag": "gates.shut-ready",
            "value": true
          },
          "then": []
        },
        {
          "id": "open",
          "objective": "Go back up to Ope.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "stage-cleared",
            "stage": "gates"
          },
          "then": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "dialogues": [
    {
      "id": "gates.intro",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "A hollow tree, taller than the canopy.\nA gate at its foot. A keeper asleep on it."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.shut-intro",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Gate's shut. It takes two to open,\nand there is only me.",
          "name": "Shut"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "A bracket with no partner is an error.\nSo I am an error. I've made my peace.",
          "name": "Shut"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Don't believe me? Stand on my mark\nand press %. It goes nowhere. You'll see.",
          "name": "Shut"
        }
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "gates.met-shut",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.shut-alone",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Still only me down here.\nThe trunk's been dark since the Flicker.",
          "name": "Shut"
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.top",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "The top of the tree. % found the\nmark's partner. So there is one."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.ope-ask",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "A visitor! From below? Nothing's below.\nI open. Nobody shuts. That's the tragedy.",
          "name": "Ope"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "A brother? If I had a brother, the trunk\nlamps would be lit. They're dark.",
          "name": "Ope"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Light them and I'll believe you. Lower one\nfirst, then the upper. Flame climbs.",
          "name": "Ope"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "The trunk is hollow, with a landing every\nhalf screen. Ctrl-d drops half a screen."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "Ctrl-u climbs half a screen.\nStand over the hollow first."
        }
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "gates.asked",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.ope-wait",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Lower lamp, then upper. Then ask the\nnobody down there what he sees.",
          "name": "Ope"
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.lamp-a",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "The lower lamp catches.\nNow the upper one: Ctrl-u climbs."
        }
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "type": "world",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "remove-entity",
              "entity": "lamp-a"
            },
            {
              "type": "spawn",
              "entity": {
                "id": "lamp-a",
                "kind": "prop",
                "sprite": "lamp-lit",
                "at": {
                  "line": 24,
                  "col": 4
                },
                "behaviour": {
                  "type": "still"
                },
                "every": 1,
                "damage": 0,
                "solid": true
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "gates.lamp-a",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.lamp-b",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "The upper lamp takes the flame.\nThe whole trunk glows."
        }
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "type": "world",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "remove-entity",
              "entity": "lamp-b"
            },
            {
              "type": "spawn",
              "entity": {
                "id": "lamp-b",
                "kind": "prop",
                "sprite": "lamp-lit",
                "at": {
                  "line": 12,
                  "col": 4
                },
                "behaviour": {
                  "type": "still"
                },
                "every": 1,
                "damage": 0,
                "solid": true
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "gates.lamp-b",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.shut-sees",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Light. In the trunk. Someone lit the\nupper lamp. You can't reach it from here.",
          "name": "Shut"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "...Unless you came down from above.\nUnless there is an above.",
          "name": "Shut"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Tell him: on three. I never stopped\ncounting. I only stopped believing.",
          "name": "Shut"
        }
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "gates.met-shut",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "gates.shut-ready",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.shut-go",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Go on. My mark, and %.\nOn three.",
          "name": "Shut"
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.ope-cure",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "On three? He said on three?\nOnly Shut says on three.",
          "name": "Ope"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "You tell him what you have seen: a lamp\nrelit, a road reopened, two lamps in a trunk."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "One... two...",
          "name": "Ope"
        }
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "gates.open",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "scribe",
          "text": "A sealed room, and you are in it. % took\nyou to this mark's partner, not the nearest."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "scribe",
          "text": "Brackets nest. The inner pair closes\nfirst. % again, and you are out."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.crack",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "Through a knothole: one gate, whole.\nOne keeper, asleep against it."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.death-hint",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "Watch the Blot on the landing. Drop when\nit steps aside: Ctrl-u, then Ctrl-d again."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    }
  ],
